WEBVTT

00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:02.233
An incoming email can contain

00:00:02.233 --> 00:00:04.700
instructions aimed at the assistant.

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:07.700
Skill Y T checks for suspicious language

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.733
and holds the message for review.

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:12.867
Classification and fixed rules decide

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:15.233
what gets an acknowledgment draft.

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:18.833
People decide what happens next.

00:00:18.967 --> 00:00:21.700
The agent has no send operation.

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:26.400
Find Skill Y T on GitHub and run the offline demo.
